From 2f603fa4874638c62758125829cca80782b1d06c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Gomez <da.gomez@kernel.org>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 23:37:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Show five lines of each step's output in a run summary

The summary dagu start and dagu status print after a run repeated the
last 50 lines of every step's stdout and stderr, which on a build
buried the result under make's output already shown while it ran.
Default to 5 and let summary_lines (DAGU_SUMMARY_LINES) set it.

Signed-off-by: Daniel Gomez <da.gomez@kernel.org>
